# Intelligent Posture-Controlled Wheelchair

This project develops an assistive robotic wheelchair that can be controlled using head or upper-body posture movements.

The system detects body posture using sensors or computer vision and converts the detected signals into directional commands for wheelchair movement.

## Features
- posture detection
- movement control
- assistive mobility support

## Technologies
Python
OpenCV
Arduino
Sensors

## Applications
Assistive technology for people with mobility disabilities.
